230
00:37:18,140 --> 00:37:23,940
君の手が触れた時にだけ震えた心があったよ
Only when your hand touched mine, did my heart tremble...

231
00:37:24,240 --> 00:37:29,640
君をいくつ超えれば僕らはたどり着けるのかな
How many of you must I cross to finally reach where we belong?

232
00:37:30,140 --> 00:37:35,940
見る草でいい　正しさのその先で
Any grass will do... Beyond what is right...

233
00:37:36,240 --> 00:37:43,940
君と手をつなぎたい　君と生きていきたい
I want to hold your hand... I want to live on with you...

234
00:38:01,640 --> 00:38:06,140
[Title: SAKURA Days (feat. AO)]

235
00:38:40,340 --> 00:38:45,940
離れる怖さとらされる全てが愛おしい
The fear of parting, everything that is captured is so dear to me...

236
00:38:46,340 --> 00:38:56,640
背中の心臓を高鳴っては　また思い耽る　サクラディス
My pounding heart echoes in my back as I drift into thought once again... Sakura Days...

237
00:39:00,940 --> 00:39:10,140
日常の木枯らしに揺るがぬ髪が懐かしい
The hair swaying in the ordinary cold wind feels so nostalgic...

238
00:39:10,540 --> 00:39:19,640
賑わいと温もりを運んでくれた　おかげで色づいた花
Bringing hustle, bustle, and warmth, the flowers bloomed in color thanks to you...

239
00:39:20,340 --> 00:39:29,640
有るものは恋い焦がれて　有るものは皆で分かち合い
Some yearn with deep love, while others share it with everyone...

240
00:39:30,140 --> 00:39:40,140
千本のまなざしを抜ける雲の　舞い散る夜風に触れ
Brushing against the evening breeze where falling petals slip past a thousand gazes...

241
00:39:40,640 --> 00:39:49,140
舞い散る夜風に触れ　切なさがし
Brushing against the falling evening breeze, a poignant search...

242
00:39:49,340 --> 00:39:58,940
さよならとありがとう　共に行くよ　おかげでまた好きになった
Saying goodbye and thank you, we'll go together... thanks to you, I've grown to love it once more.

243
00:40:00,741 --> 00:40:04,841
譲るものを 追えるはずなく
There's no way we could chase after what we surrender...

244
00:40:05,311 --> 00:40:09,711
来るものは 拒めるわけない
And no way we can turn away what comes our way.

245
00:40:10,111 --> 00:40:13,811
遥か彼方 遠い桜色の日々よ
Oh, those distant cherry blossom days far away...

246
00:40:14,411 --> 00:40:19,511
離れる覚悟 捉え全てが愛おしい
Embracing the readiness to part, everything feels so precious.

247
00:40:25,811 --> 00:40:35,011
セピアの心情を開いては また思い耽る
Opening up sepia-toned feelings, I drift into thought once more.

248
00:40:35,911 --> 00:40:38,811
SAKURA Days...

249
00:40:39,411 --> 00:40:44,311
遥か彼方響く君の声に耳をすませば
